  "bodyHash": "78c73dab4f59ecb0",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:line-through\">(我的第一个模组/数据包)</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/952176/description_a926bc6e-7202-4d5d-b3ec-ad14554db92e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"808\" height=\"361\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>史诗武士、史诗骑士、地牢武器、生于混沌、Simply Swords 以及多个其他模组武器的兼容性支持，涵盖 Epic Fight（史诗战斗）、Weapons of Miracles（奇迹武器）、Epic Fight Battle Styles（史诗战斗战斗风格）及其他插件。</strong></h3>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>还有更多！EFM Compat 的全新 Trails（轨迹）材质包！<br></strong></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">预期兼容</span></span></span> (<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">完整体验所必需的依赖项</span>)：</h1>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/881/915/638312712562327674.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"202\" height=\"202\"></a></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight（史诗战斗）</a> by maninthe_home/yesman</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/884/152/638318074504658168.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"202\" height=\"202\"></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/weapons-of-miracles-epicfight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Weapons of Miracles（奇迹武器）</a> (wom) by reascer</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ef-bs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/915/178/638372918905326451.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"202\" height=\"202\"></a></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ef-bs\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight Battle Styles（史诗战斗战斗风格）</a> (ef-bs) by Forixaim</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-guandao-moveset\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/862/853/638271674802985984.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"202\" height=\"202\"></a></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-guandao-moveset\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight - Guandao Moveset（长柄武器动作组）</a> (falchionmoveset) by namelesslk</h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>请查看附加文件以下载资源包，以修复和添加新材质。</strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>（在我弄清楚如何将其内置到数据包中之前，这是获取材质包的唯一方式）</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/952176/description_20d558b2-164b-4554-937a-789442eeaa53.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"721\" height=\"384\"></strong></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">推荐搭配：</h1>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/epic-fight-x-irons-spells-armor-fix\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/963/317/638461000018381994.png\" alt=\"logo\" width=\"160\" height=\"160\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/epic-fight-x-irons-spells-armor-fix\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight x Iron's Spells Armor Fix（史诗战斗 × 伊恩的魔法护甲修复）</a>&nbsp;by cacheing</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">此数据包/模组旨在让 Epic Fight（史诗战斗）兼容多种模组。武器动作组基于我个人喜好进行了调整，欢迎根据个人喜好自行修改。</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>尝试你自己的战斗风格：</strong></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">如何为 Epic Fight（史诗战斗）制作自定义武器与护甲的数据包：</h4>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fepicfight-docs.readthedocs.io%252fGuides%252fpage2%252f%2523onetwo-handed-weapon-file\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://epicfight-docs.readthedocs.io/Guides/page2/#onetwo-handed-weapon-file</a></h4>\n<hr>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">武器来源：</h2>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/born-in-chaos\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/778/486/638122554849559119.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"202\" height=\"202\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/born-in-chaos\" rel=\"nofollow\">Born In Chaos（生于混沌）</a> by mongoose_artist</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-samurais\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/805/606/638172713304550451.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-samurais\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Samurai（史诗武士）</a> by VeroxUniverse</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-armor-and-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/411/944/637630777607986862.png\" alt=\"Epic Knights\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-armor-and-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Knights（史诗骑士）</a>/magistuarmory by magistu_</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minecraft-dungeons-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/789/196/638143347801778495.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minecraft-dungeons-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dungeons Weapons（地牢武器）</a> by thespringaling</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simply-swords\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/611/576/637996129346404798.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simply-swords\" rel=\"nofollow\">-Simply Swords（简易剑）</a> by sweenuss</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-and-fire-dragons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/190/975/636857615673605328.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-and-fire-dragons\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ice and Fire: Dragons（冰与火之龙）</a>&nbsp;by sbom_xela</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mcdw\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/937/893/638416517376113534.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mcdw\" rel=\"nofollow\">MC Dungeon Weapons（MC地牢武器）</a> by chronos_sacaria</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-addon\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/892/693/638335183690820532.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-addon\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Knights Addon（史诗骑士扩展）</a>by magistu_</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ob-aquamirae\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/464/755/637744772991786976.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ob-aquamirae\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aquamirae（水之奇迹）</a> by Obscuria</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabled-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/897/696/638342973699298752.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabled-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabled（传说）</a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabled-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\">Weaponry（武器库）</a> by DaddyUnion</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/396/11/637595005615179370.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight（农夫乐事）</a> by verctorwing</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irons-spells-n-spellbooks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/871/265/638288661913483053.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irons-spells-n-spellbooks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks（伊恩的魔法与法典）</a> by Iron431</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/l_ender-s-cataclysm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/460/870/637739722679428303.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/l_ender-s-cataclysm\" rel=\"nofollow\">L_Ender 's Cataclysm（L_Ender的天灾）</a> by mcl_ender</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/reliquary-reincarnations\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/506/233/637824423557821613.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/reliquary-reincarnations\" rel=\"nofollow\">Reliquary Reincarnations（遗物转生）</a> by P3pp3rF1y</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vampirism-become-a-vampire\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/258/931/637209858883035931.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vampirism-become-a-vampire\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vampirism - Become a vampire!（吸血鬼：化身吸血鬼！）</a> by maxanier and Cheaterpaul</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/daves-potioneering\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/566/189/637924794889476652.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/daves-potioneering\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dave's Potioneering（戴夫的药水制作）</a>by SoterDave</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/816/783/638194171174203953.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Aether（天域）</a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp;</a>by TheAetherTeam</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/basic-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/883/158/638315999771583464.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/basic-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\">Basic Weapons（基础武器）</a> by Khazoda</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomancy\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/838/790/638231371029924457.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomancy\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomancy（生物法术）</a> by Elenterius</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blue-skies\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/241/891/637131079632015619.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blue-skies\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blue Skies（碧蓝天空）</a> by ModdingLegacy</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elementus\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/923/798/638390956074205375.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elementus-arcane\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/923/851/638391125861006765.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elementus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Elementus（元素使）</a> &amp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elementus-arcane\" rel=\"nofollow\">Elementus:Arcane（元素使：奥术）</a> by Nokunami</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-paladins\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/834/456/638225202891768109.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-empires\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/889/312/638328880372078491.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-paladins\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Paladins（史诗圣骑士）</a> &amp; <a style=\"background-color:rgb(38, 38, 38)\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-empires\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Empires（史诗帝国）</a> by VeroxUniverse</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forbidden-arcanus\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/772/533/638112628921999420.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forbidden-arcanus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forbidden Arcanus（禁忌奥术）</a> by cesar_zorak</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/knaves-needs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/761/310/638097611993061146.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/knaves-needs\" rel=\"nofollow\">Knave's Needs（恶棍所需）</a> by KodoDenka</strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/l2weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/796/600/638156948581632807.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/l2weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\">L2 Weaponry</a> от Icy0x1</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rpg-style-more-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/555/994/637900334510568136.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rpg-style-more-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\">-Больше оружия в стиле RPG</a></strong><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rpg-style-more-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\"> от zrikon</a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-weapons-for-better-combat\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/614/129/637997268560849585.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-weapons-for-better-combat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Простое оружие для Better Combat</a><em> <s>(Теперь для Epic Fight!)</s>&nbsp;</em>от InfernalEclipse</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/14/212/635589178760357568.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Twilight Forest</a> от Benimatic</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-undergarden\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/280/925/637283672869883111.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-undergarden\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Undergarden</a> от Quek04</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/plus-the-end\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/628/679/638025764121686580.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/plus-the-end\" rel=\"nofollow\">Plus the End</a> от praizazdd7724 (только для 1.8)</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eeeabs-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/887/654/638325263575103332.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eeeabs-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\">EEEAB's Mobs</a> от EEEAB</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>И ещё больше в будущем!...</strong></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">Другая совместимость:</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/recruits\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/825/222/638210773187460598.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/recruits\" rel=\"nofollow\">Villager Recruits</a> от talhanation</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relics-of-gaming-continued\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/896/228/638341222431292689.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relics-of-gaming-continued\" rel=\"nofollow\">Relics Of Gaming Continued</a> (Изменены только следы) от power282</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">Датапак создан <strong>ElC4</strong> при участии Йохана Петровича, основанный на других датапаках, таких как:</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-simplyswords with epicfight от sunwoolove777</h4>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-epic-knights-EFM из (Discord-сервера epic knights)</h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">Вопросы и ответы</h1>\n<hr>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Можете добавить этот мод [вставьте название любого мода на оружие]?</strong></h4>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Я знаю о модах, которые предлагают в комментариях. Как только у меня появится время поработать над модом, я протестирую их, чтобы проверить совместимость с Epic Fight. Некоторые моды, такие как Weapons Masters, имеют собственную боевую механику, поэтому попытка заставить их работать с Epic Fight приведёт к хаосу. Именно поэтому их нужно сначала тестировать.</em></h5>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">Так как это мой первый датапак/мод, можно сказать, что я просто прыгаю в глубокий бассейн, не умея плавать. Я мало знаю о Java и до конца не понимаю, как это работает с модами для Minecraft, но учусь. Кроме того, я студент, поэтому, вероятно, буду занят другими делами, а в свободное время чаще всего играю во что-то другое. Надеюсь на ваше понимание.</p>\n<p>Также извините за возможные ошибки в английском, он не является моим родным языком.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>",
